{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（6日）早上7時半，警方接報，大埔海濱公園近大景街對開海面上，發現有人在海中載浮載沉。救援人員趕至現場將一名男子救起，經檢驗後證實他已當場死亡。</p><p>警方經初步調查，證實死者為28歲姓陳男子。現場沒有檢獲遺書；警方將案件列作「自殺」，正調查陳男墮海原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"水警人員在海上搜索。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184056388943745024298607.jpeg/Vdp_ZrXANL5ahsBnWgqAfxvqMTUmempK_RIbMtgSGzI\"/><figcaption>水警人員在海上搜索。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是大埔海濱公園對開海面。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184056391745671168493258.jpeg/9W1WwWfcDl1HUUY6kzFd-8mfkYE_oDYNpUkDfIBJA3w\"/><figcaption>現場是大埔海濱公園對開海面。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184056383197286400162803.jpeg/3kzs-XeTcsUnYgFOeUPfu5x7vcJlg5u4fx4z51oeM-c\"/><figcaption>人員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184056380076593152137048.jpeg/XT46twaKl2Wd6bcorI7J3qmrrLZPBddhV_k_cHL5P3A\"/><figcaption>人員以綠色帳篷遮蓋遺體。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184056386074710016639517.jpeg/S5U7NCJ7lAu3OzfF3kmd1PBmsnwaH6B7Vc18a3DNfGs\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T09:01:33.898211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}